{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1504279-is-it-weird-to-spend-a-day-just-making-characters","id":1504279,"title":"Is it weird to spend a day just making characters?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-03-03T11:28:31-08:00","id":1504279,"title":"Is it weird to spend a day just making characters?","content":"This is technically an rpg post but not really specific to any one so I put it here. <br /> <br /> Has anyone else here ever spent time just creating rpg characters, even if they don't have a game session or a campaign? What I mean is, do you make characters to practice getting your head around the character creation system of a game you haven't tried? So you do this to practice, and remind yourself how the system works? Or do you do this because you're just bored?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-03T12:43:17-08:00","id":1504287,"title":"","content":"I tell myself stories when I'm bored or trying to fall asleep, which is made easier when there's a framework to operate within. Making random character -rough drafts of them, anyway- helps a lot with that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-03T14:04:30-08:00","id":1504293,"title":"","content":"I don't do it nearly as much as I did when I was younger, but making characters just for the fun of it was one of my old past times for what to do on long trips. Obviously going from being a passenger to the driver didn't help a lot to continue that practice.<br /> <br /> I wouldn't say I had any distinct goals with it; especially as it was long before having your whole collection on PDFs and a small laptop to travel with. It was just something fun to do. In systems I know well enough, I could just use some paper and a pencil and make up characters (the vast majority I never used) because it was mentally simulating.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-03T17:30:51-08:00","id":1504304,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Father Enoch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1504279-is-it-weird-to-spend-a-day-just-making-characters#post1504279\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is technically an rpg post but not really specific to any one so I put it here.<br /> <br /> Has anyone else here ever spent time just creating rpg characters, even if they don't have a game session or a campaign? What I mean is, do you make characters to practice getting your head around the character creation system of a game you haven't tried? So you do this to practice, and remind yourself how the system works? Or do you do this because you're just bored?</div> </div> </div> </div>Like what <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar617_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"617\" data-vbnamecard=\"617\">Heavy Arms</a> said, it's not something that I do as much these days because I'm running several games at the moment, but I used to just spend hours creating characters and going over the books to see what works. I didn't have a lot of people to play with back then, especially not for Storyteller stuff, so I was just kind of on my lonesome in creating things. Discord helped open things up a little, so now that I'm making groups with people I don't have as much energy to do as I did before.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-03T19:10:04-08:00","id":1504316,"title":"","content":"When I first started playing RPGs, yeah; now, I'll find online character generators like Hero-Machine or Hero-Forge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-03T19:20:05-08:00","id":1504318,"title":"","content":"But Hero Forge just makes miniatures, doesn't it? I meant characters as in sheets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-03T19:37:19-08:00","id":1504324,"title":"","content":"Depends. Sometimes i sketch out some concept or backstory, others i jot stats around for the sake of a build or whatever - and then there are times i just steal a character template from a splatbook and jot down some small bits to customize it into an almost fully fleshed out PC or NPC.<br /> <br /> And then just throw the lot of them into some file compilation or other for use when the opportunity to play or GM strikes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-04T08:15:05-08:00","id":1504363,"title":"","content":"I'll do it for practice, with a new system (speeds up session zeros). I'll also do it for fun, or if an interesting concept strikes me.<br /> <br /> I'll also sometimes roll random stats and make a game out of making the random nonsense make sense (I couldn't make the professional wrestler Tremere make any sense, but she was a memorable concept).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><sup><i>Prone to hyperbole</i></sup>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","name":"Rhywbeth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-05T10:36:46-08:00","id":1504459,"title":"","content":"Not at all. When I was younger and had a burst of creative inspiration about a character and there backstory. It wouldn\u2019t be shocking to see how much time would pass as the backstory would gell and a good non player character or player character would emerge. It was like the old story of how Athena erupted fully formed from Zeus.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 03-05-2023, 04:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-07T19:23:40-08:00","id":1504804,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Father Enoch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1504279-is-it-weird-to-spend-a-day-just-making-characters?p=1504318#post1504318\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But Hero Forge just makes miniatures, doesn't it? I meant characters as in sheets.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is true; I've played so many RPGs that, when I create a character, create a concept and rarely assign stats because I haven't decided if, it's for Vampire: Requiem or Cyberpunk 2020: Night's Edge game. Any RPG game will do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-11T11:02:37-08:00","id":1505126,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iguazu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1504279-is-it-weird-to-spend-a-day-just-making-characters?p=1504804#post1504804\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That is true; I've played so many RPGs that, when I create a character, create a concept and rarely assign stats because I haven't decided if, it's for Vampire: Requiem or Cyberpunk 2020: Night's Edge game. Any RPG game will do.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know the feeling when I come up with a concept that could work well with Mage The Awakening or Changeling The Lost. I never had any troubles when it came to creating characters when it came to Vampire The Masquerade or the Requiem.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-11T18:44:55-08:00","id":1505152,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1504279-is-it-weird-to-spend-a-day-just-making-characters?p=1505126#post1505126\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I know the feeling when I come up with a concept that could work well with Mage The Awakening or Changeling The Lost. I never had any troubles when it came to creating characters when it came to Vampire The Masquerade or the Requiem.</div> </div> </div> </div>When we got Masquerade, we also go the Player's Guide and I went crazy with the Mortals-sheet; I went to the copy-shop, five-cents a copy and would get twenty or forty sheets at a time and make massive amounts of mortal-NPCs for V:tM. I felt that vampire was more of a mortal-driven game and instead of having my players roll for blood-points, I'd have them role-play the hunt. Just rolling a few dice to see how much Blood they got was like, just rolling a few die to see how much Gold the players got in a D&amp;D dungeon. Human-interactions was apart of the game. <br /> <br /> When Dark-Ages game out, I made a Dark Ages Character Concept generator-program and went from there. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-12T10:55:01-07:00","id":1505181,"title":"","content":"Compelling backstories and flaws never get old.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-22T17:40:28-07:00","id":1506193,"title":"","content":"Especially with editable .PDFs; if they're like Judicial-Council Forms, you should be able to edit them if you download them to your computer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-23T11:31:11-07:00","id":1506252,"title":"","content":"I do this - both for practice, and with any RPG which has a rich Character Generation sequence. I also like to have some characters ready to be NPCs for when I run games.<br /> It sure beats watching TV or on-line gambling! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27867-brasidas19004","name":"brasidas19004","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-25T10:21:56-07:00","id":1506423,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brasidas19004</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1504279-is-it-weird-to-spend-a-day-just-making-characters?p=1506252#post1506252\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do this - both for practice, and with any RPG which has a rich Character Generation sequence. I also like to have some characters ready to be NPCs for when I run games.<br /> It sure beats watching TV or on-line gambling! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not missing much on tv. Though watching HGTV, Inside The NBA and Dr. Pol or stuff on National Geographic never gets old and I make time for that along with reading a wide array of books.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-25T16:18:29-07:00","id":1506441,"title":"","content":"I hated making up NPCs on the fly or having saved ones, but, when you're gaming all the time, you don't have any time to create, really. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1504279-is-it-weird-to-spend-a-day-just-making-characters?p=1506423#post1506423\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not missing much on tv. Though watching HGTV, Inside The NBA and Dr. Pol or stuff on National Geographic never gets old and I make time for that along with reading a wide array of books.</div> </div> </div> </div>I got rid of my TV a decade ago. Nothing on, but I do like Nat. Geo channel. When I was younger, I'd watch movies, seriously; I would record VHS, three to a tape and save them to watch them; when I had TV, I would watch movies, occasionally, then just have the TV on in the background while I bumped around on the computer. Now, I don't watch movies anymore; I had to figure out, again how to play a DVD again. I asked for a DVD-player for XMas when they came out, and used it like, four times until it broke, years later.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T10:13:30-07:00","id":1506491,"title":"","content":"I mostly watch films from Asia now and I greatly appreciate the art form.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}